<!-- ===== FAQ ===== -->
<section id="faq" class="faq-section" aria-labelledby="faq-heading">
    <div class="section">
        <p class="section-tag">FAQ</p>
        <h2 class="section-title" id="faq-heading">Common questions, answered honestly.</h2>
        <div class="faq-grid">
            <div class="faq-item">
                <h4>Do you only work with large companies?</h4>
                <p>Not at all. We work with startups, SMEs and enterprise teams alike. If you have a real problem, we can help, regardless of size.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-item">
                <h4>How much does a custom software project cost?</h4>
                <p>Every project is scoped individually. Simple systems start from around R 15,000. We provide a detailed quote with no hidden costs before anything starts.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-item">
                <h4>How long does a project take to deliver?</h4>
                <p>Timelines depend on complexity. Small tools: 2 to 4 weeks. Full platforms: 6 to 12 weeks. We give you a realistic estimate upfront and stick to it.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-item">
                <h4>What technologies do you specialise in?</h4>
                <p>We specialise in the Microsoft stack: ASP.NET Core, SQL Server, Azure and Power BI. We also work with React, REST APIs, Docker and AI integrations.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-item">
                <h4>Will I own the source code?</h4>
                <p>Yes. Once the project is paid for, you own 100% of the code, databases and documentation. No lock-in.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-item">
                <h4>Can you work with our existing systems?</h4>
                <p>Absolutely. We regularly integrate with legacy platforms, third-party APIs and existing databases. We work with what you have and improve it.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

